Here is the Scores chart's spec: a bar of side by the mean of accessibility. Paste it into the node's editor:

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v6.json",
  "mark": "bar",
  "encoding": {
    "x": {
      "field": "side",
      "type": "nominal"
    },
    "y": {
      "field": "accessibility",
      "type": "quantitative",
      "aggregate": "mean"
    }
  }
}
```

Here is the Counts chart's spec: a line of pedestrians by hour. Paste it into the node's editor:

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v6.json",
  "mark": "line",
  "encoding": {
    "x": {
      "field": "hour",
      "type": "temporal"
    },
    "y": {
      "field": "pedestrians",
      "type": "quantitative"
    }
  }
}
```

Here is the Roofs chart's spec: a histogram of VEGETATED_SQFT. Paste it into the node's editor:

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v6.json",
  "mark": "bar",
  "encoding": {
    "x": {
      "field": "VEGETATED_SQFT",
      "type": "quantitative",
      "bin": true
    },
    "y": {
      "aggregate": "count",
      "type": "quantitative"
    }
  }
}
```
